  <paragraphs>
    <title>Classification version: Polynomial regression</title>
    <p>
      <md>
        \Pr(y_i&gt;250 \mid x_i) =
        \frac{\exp(\beta_0+\beta_1x_i+\cdots+\beta_dx_i^d)}
        {1+\exp(\beta_0+\beta_1x_i+\cdots+\beta_dx_i^d)}
      </md>
